        <body>
            <div xml:id="d621">

                <pb facs="0775" n="667" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg667"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Whitehouse to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1891-03-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 15,
                    1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Whitehouse informs Mr. Blaine that the news from New Orleans had deeply moved
                    the Italian Government, which urges the President to use every exertion possible
                    to protect Italians.</p>
            </div>
